  "description": "Warbird C GX Eagle AXS isn’t just any carbon fiber gravel bike. It’s comfortable, versatile, and race-ready all at the same time. Warbird’s geometry and our Class 5™ VRS (vibration reduction system) are designed to decrease fatigue and increase stability over rough gravel roads. A full collection of cargo mounts lets you bring extra water, nutrition, layers, tools, and more on rides that push your limits. The SRAM GX Eagle AXS drivetrain has the gearing for monumental climbs and tailwind-fueled flats, with the speed and ease of electronic shifting. Chase gravel adventures with Warbird.",
